flowchart LR
  INITIATIVE["Product initiative<br/>user or operator need and evidence"] --> REQUIREMENTS["Requirements and acceptance criteria<br/>owned by an identified product steward"]
  REQUIREMENTS --> SOURCEISSUE["Typed source Issue<br/>in the product repository"]
  SOURCEISSUE --> TRIAGE["Human prioritization<br/>Project is planning context only"]
  TRIAGE --> AUTH["Source-Issue identity, permission, policy, and contract gates"]
  AUTH -->|pass| BOOTSTRAP["Authorized repository bootstrap<br/>pinned Distribution and Primitive sources"]
  AUTH -->|unknown or fail| HOLD["Hold without creating or mutating a repository"]
  BOOTSTRAP --> IMPLEMENT["Bounded feature implementation<br/>Actions and Codex in the origin repository"]
  IMPLEMENT --> PR["Issue-linked pull request<br/>automated checks and independent review"]
  PR --> HUMAN["Human merge and release decision"]
  HUMAN --> EVAL["Product outcome evaluation<br/>observed behavior, users, and stated window"]
  EVAL --> NEXT["Reviewed result or unmet need"]
  NEXT --> SOURCEISSUE
  GATE["Product repository creation, steward, feedback path, and rollout require explicit maintainer approval"]
  GATE -.-> INITIATIVE
  STATUS["Current inventory: no distinct product repository, steward, or product outcome baseline identified"]
  STATUS -.-> REQUIREMENTS
  STATUS -.-> EVAL
